and magic weapons are coming soon~\n\n{2171295976743324}\n\n**\u2694\ufe0f Fight With What You Made**\n\nDefeat monsters and challenge powerful bosses with the weapons you forged.\n\n{1259225426386657}\n\n**\ud83e\udebd Fly Through the Air**\n\nSoar through the skies with smooth movement and explore the world from above.\n\n{2070716323487044}", "short_description": "Join discord in [Discord.gg/soulforge]\n\nMine, forge, fight, and fly with friends in Soul Forge, a FREE multiplayer VR social adventure.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Forge Your Weapon\n\nCollect more than 100 unique swords. Ranged and magic weapons are coming soon~\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Fight With What You Made\n\nDefeat monsters and challenge powerful bosses with the weapons you forged.\n\n\ud83e\udebd Fly in the Air\n\nSoar through the skies with smooth movement and explore the world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.soulforgevr.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.soulforgevr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Dragonhorse Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.soulforgevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "28387086324302544"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri"